{"title":"Career Roadmap: Maintenance Engineer","role":"Maintenance Engineer","summary":"A Maintenance Engineer ensures that machinery, equipment and mechanical systems operate safely, reliably and with minimum unplanned downtime.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Tech / B.E.","Course":"Mechanical Engineering"},"about":[{"label":"Primary Goal","text":"Develop expertise in equipment maintenance, troubleshooting, reliability, preventive maintenance, condition monitoring and plant operations"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Roadmap Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"A Maintenance Engineer ensures that machinery, equipment and mechanical systems operate safely, reliably and with minimum unplanned downtime."},{"type":"p","text":"The role combines:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Mechanical engineering"},{"text":"Equipment troubleshooting"},{"text":"Preventive maintenance"},{"text":"Predictive maintenance"},{"text":"Reliability engineering"},{"text":"Condition monitoring"},{"text":"Maintenance planning"},{"text":"Industrial safety"},{"text":"Spare-parts management"},{"text":"Data-driven maintenance"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Typical industries include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Manufacturing"},{"text":"Automotive"},{"text":"Steel and metals"},{"text":"Oil & gas"},{"text":"Power generation"},{"text":"Cement"},{"text":"Chemicals"},{"text":"Pharmaceuticals"},{"text":"Food processing"},{"text":"Mining"},{"text":"Railways"},{"text":"Industrial automation"}]}]},{"heading":"What to Build During UG","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Build This","Learn From","Proof of Skill","Gap to Avoid"],"rows":[[{"text":"1st Year"},{"text":"Mechanical fundamentals"},{"text":"Mechanics, Physics, Mathematics"},{"text":"Basic equipment studies"},{"text":"Weak fundamentals"}],[{"text":"2nd Year"},{"text":"Equipment knowledge"},{"text":"Materials, Manufacturing, Thermodynamics"},{"text":"Equipment documentation"},{"text":"Learning only theory"}],[{"text":"3rd Year"},{"text":"Maintenance engineering"},{"text":"Machine Design, Fluid Mechanics, Measurements"},{"text":"Maintenance projects"},{"text":"No troubleshooting ability"}],[{"text":"4th Year"},{"text":"Reliability + plant operations"},{"text":"Condition Monitoring, Reliability, Safety"},{"text":"Industrial internship + capstone"},{"text":"No real equipment exposure"}]]}]},{"heading":"Semester-by-Semester Roadmap","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Semester 1"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Engineering Mathematics"},{"text":"Engineering Physics"},{"text":"Engineering Mechanics"},{"text":"Engineering Graphics"},{"text":"Introduction to Mechanical Engineering"},{"text":"Basic workshop practice"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 2"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Materials Science"},{"text":"Manufacturing Processes"},{"text":"Engineering Drawing"},{"text":"Basic electrical concepts"},{"text":"Workshop and machine-shop practice"},{"text":"Basic programming"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 3"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Strength of Materials"},{"text":"Thermodynamics"},{"text":"Fluid Mechanics"},{"text":"Machine Drawing"},{"text":"Mechanical Measurements"},{"text":"Engineering materials"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 4"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Theory of Machines"},{"text":"Manufacturing Technology"},{"text":"Heat Transfer"},{"text":"Machine Design fundamentals"},{"text":"Hydraulic systems"},{"text":"Pneumatic systems"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 5"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Machine Design"},{"text":"Industrial Engineering"},{"text":"Production Engineering"},{"text":"Instrumentation"},{"text":"Maintenance engineering"},{"text":"Reliability fundamentals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 6"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Preventive maintenance"},{"text":"Predictive maintenance"},{"text":"Condition monitoring"},{"text":"Vibration analysis"},{"text":"Lubrication"},{"t