wers"},{"text":"Motors"},{"text":"Gearboxes"},{"text":"Turbines"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Static Equipment"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Pressure vessels"},{"text":"Heat exchangers"},{"text":"Storage tanks"},{"text":"Boilers"},{"text":"Piping systems"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Mechanical Transmission"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Gears"},{"text":"Belts"},{"text":"Chains"},{"text":"Couplings"},{"text":"Bearings"},{"text":"Shafts"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Utilities"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"HVAC"},{"text":"Cooling towers"},{"text":"Chillers"},{"text":"Air compressors"},{"text":"Steam systems"},{"text":"Water-treatment systems"}]}]},{"heading":"Maintenance Strategies","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Understand the difference between major maintenance approaches."},{"type":"table","header":["Strategy","Purpose","Example"],"rows":[[{"text":"Corrective"},{"text":"Repair after failure/problem"},{"text":"Replace failed bearing"}],[{"text":"Preventive"},{"text":"Maintenance at planned intervals"},{"text":"Scheduled bearing replacement"}],[{"text":"Predictive"},{"text":"Maintain based on condition"},{"text":"Vibration-based intervention"}],[{"text":"Condition-Based"},{"text":"Act on measured equipment condition"},{"text":"Temperature/pressure threshold"}],[{"text":"Proactive"},{"text":"Eliminate root causes"},{"text":"Correct alignment problem"}],[{"text":"Reliability-Centered"},{"text":"Select maintenance based on failure consequences"},{"text":"Critical equipment strategy"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"The goal is not simply to perform more maintenance. It is to achieve safe and reliable operation with an appropriate maintenance strategy."}]},{"heading":"Preventive Maintenance","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn how to create maintenance schedules for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Bearings"},{"text":"Pumps"},{"text":"Motors"},{"text":"Compressors"},{"text":"Gearboxes"},{"text":"Conveyors"},{"text":"Hydraulic systems"},{"text":"Pneumatic systems"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Important activities:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Inspection"},{"text":"Lubrication"},{"text":"Cleaning"},{"text":"Alignment"},{"text":"Tightening"},{"text":"Replacement"},{"text":"Calibration"},{"text":"Functional testing"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn how to develop:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Equipment","Maintenance Task","Frequency","Procedure","Required Tools","Spare Parts","Safety Precautions","Completion Record"]}]},{"heading":"Predictive Maintenance & Condition Monitoring","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"This is an important modern specialization."},{"type":"h","text":"Vibration Monitoring"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Vibration fundamentals"},{"text":"Frequency"},{"text":"Amplitude"},{"text":"FFT"},{"text":"Spectrum analysis"},{"text":"Bearing fault signatures"},{"text":"Unbalance"},{"text":"Misalignment"},{"text":"Looseness"},{"text":"Resonance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Thermal Monitoring"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Infrared thermography"},{"text":"Temperature trends"},{"text":"Hot-spot identification"},{"text":"Electrical/mechanical overheating"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Other Techniques"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Oil analysis"},{"text":"Ultrasonic inspection"},{"text":"Motor-current analysis"},{"text":"Pressure monitoring"},{"text":"Flow monitoring"},{"text":"Acoustic monitoring"}]}]},{"heading":"Reliability Engineering","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Reliability"},{"text":"Availability"},{"text":"Maintainability"},{"text":"Failure rate"},{"text":"Mean Time Between Failures (MTBF)"},{"text":"Mean Time To Repair (MTTR)"},{"text":"Failure modes"},{"text":"Failure Mode and Effects Analysis (FMEA)"},{"text":"Fault Tree Analysis"},{"text":"Root Cause Analysis"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Important metrics:"},{"type":"h","text":"Availability ≈ Uptime / (Uptime + Downtime)"},{"type":"p","text":"and:"},{"type":"h","text":"MTTR = Total Repair Time / Number of Repairs"},{"type":"p","text":"Use these metrics to identify equipment and maintenance problems rather than relying only on subjective observations."}]},{"heading":"Troubleshooting Skills","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Develop a systematic troubleshooting method."},{"type":"note","label":"Example","text":"Pump Failure"},{"type":"flow","items":["Symptom","Possible Causes","Inspection","Measurement","Root Cause","Corrective Action","Verification"]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential causes:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Misalignment"},{"text":"Cavitation"},{"text":"Bearing failure"},{"text":"Seal failure"},{"text":"Impeller damage"},{"text":"Incorrect operating conditions"},{"text":"Lubrication problem"},{"text":"Pipe blockage"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn to distinguish between:"},{"type":"h","text":"symptom ≠ failure mode ≠ root cause"}]},{"heading":"Root Cause Analysis","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"5 Whys"},{"text":"Fishbone/Ishikawa analysis"},{"text":"Fault Tree Analysis"},{"text":"FMEA"},{"text":"Pareto analysis"},{"text":"Failure history analysis"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"h","text":"Bearing failure"},{"type":"flow","items":["Why? Excessive vibration","Why? Misalignment","Why? Improper installation","Why? Alignment procedure not followed","Why? No standardized maintenance procedure"]},{"type":"p","text":"The objective is to prevent recurrence rather than repeatedly replacing the failed component."}]},{"heading":"Maintenance Tools & Digital Systems","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"h","text":"CMMS"},{"type":"p","text":"Computerized Maintenance Management Systems are used for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Work orders"},{"text":"Preventive maintenance schedules"},{"text":"Equipment history"},{"text":"Spare parts"},{"text":"Maintenance teams"},{"text":"Maintenance costs"},{"text":"Asset records"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Examples include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SAP PM"},{"text":"IBM Maximo"},{"text":"Oracle maintenance systems"},{"text":"Other industrial CMMS platforms"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Data Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Python basics"},{"text":"SQL basics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Use data to analyze:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Equipment downtime"},{"text":"Failure frequency"},{"text":"Maintenance costs"},{"text":"MTBF"},{"text":"MTTR"},{"text":"Spare-part consumption"}]}]},{"heading":"Industrial Safety","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Safety is a core requirement of maintenance engineering."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the principles behind:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Lockout/Tagout"},{"text":"Permit-to-work systems"},{"text":"Electrical isolation"},{"text":"Mechanical isolation"},{"text":"Pressure isolation"},{"text":"Confined-space procedures"},{"text":"Work-at-height safety"},{"text":"PPE"},{"text":"Machine guarding"},{"text":"Hot-work safety"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Actual procedures must always follow the employer's site rules, applicable law and authorized safety procedures."}]},{"heading":"Projects to Build","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Pump Maintenance & Reliability Study"},{"type":"p","text":"Select a centrifugal pump."},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Components"},{"text":"Operating principle"},{"text":"Failure modes"},{"text":"Preventive maintenance"},{"text":"Lubrication"},{"text":"Alignment"},{"text":"Vibration"},{"text":"MTBF/MTTR"},{"text":"Spare parts"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Create a complete maintenance plan."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Predictive Maintenance Using Vibration Data"},{"type":"p","text":"Use an equipment vibration dataset."},{"type":"p","text":"Build a workflow:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Raw vibration","Signal processing","FFT","Feature extraction","Fault classification","Maintenance recommendation"]},{"type":"p","text":"Possible faults:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Unbalance"},{"text":"Misalignment"},{"text":"Bearing defect"},{"text":"Looseness"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Python can be used for signal processing and visualization."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Industrial Maintenance Dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a Power BI/Excel dashboard containing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Equipment inventory"},{"text":"Failure frequency"},{"text":"Downtime"},{"text":"MTBF"},{"text":"MTTR"},{"text":"Maintenance cost"},{"text":"Preventive-maintenance compliance"},{"text":"Critical equipment"},{"text":"Spare-parts consumption"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This demonstrates the combination of mechanical engineering + data analysis."}]},{"heading":"Advanced Capstone Project","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Predictive Maintenance System for Industrial Pump"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Equipment Model","Sensor Data","Data Collection","Condition Monitoring","Fault Detection","Maintenance Decision"]},{"type":"p","text":"Include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Equipment study"},{"text":"Failure-mode analysis"},{"text":"Sensor selection"},{"text":"Vibration/temperature data"},{"text":"Data preprocessing"},{"text":"Fault detection"},{"text":"Remaining-useful-life concept"},{"text":"Maintenance recommendation"},{"text":"Dashboard"},{"text":"Cost-benefit analysis"}]},{"type":"p","text":"If using real industrial equipment, data collection and access must be authorized and conducted under appropriate safety procedures."}]},{"heading":"Choose a Specialization","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Specialization","Additional Skills","Potential Roles"],"rows":[[{"text":"Plant Maintenance"},{"text":"Equipment + maintenance planning"},{"text":"Maintenance Engineer"}],[{"text":"Reliability"},{"text":"FMEA, RCA, reliability metrics"}